<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text padd-b-32 aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div id="text-ca5c997678" class="cmp-text">
    <h2><b>WBL 2026 Data</b></h2>
<p>The WBL 2026 dataset is available in Excel and Stata formats and covers 190 economies across 10 topics, providing data on legal frameworks, supportive frameworks, and enforcement perceptions. A reproducibility package with code and documentation is available to support transparent analysis and replication. </p>
<p>The 2026 edition also includes data recalculated under the WBL 1.0 methodology, extending the historical series and enabling consistent comparisons over time. It further includes 2024–2025 data aligned with the 2026 methodology to ensure continuity across editions.</p>

</div>

    


	
    


 
</div>
